		{
			dependencies: ["4A1FAA8AFF2B1DC1"]
			description: ["Mechanical Crafters are Brass Age blocks that can be placed next to each other to form a crafting grid. Some items require a larger crafting grid and can only be made with Mechanical Crafters, like a Crushing Wheel for example."]
